        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the named legacy dungeon in the required mode and complete its scripted boss events.\n\n1. Normal is sufficient; Heroic also credits the Normal clear. Fly to the Frozen Halls alcove high on Icecrown Citadel's WEST face (52.6, 89.4). Take the LEFT portal labelled The Forge of Souls; the ground-level raid entrance is elsewhere.\n\n2. If following the Frozen Halls story, take Echoes of Tortured Souls from Jaina (Alliance) or Sylvanas (Horde) just inside. Follow the winding walkway and defeat Bronjahm. Destroy approaching Soul Fragments during an ordinary clear; Soul Power requires a different setup.\n\n3. Continue to the final platform and defeat the Devourer of Souls. Interrupt Phantom Blast if it survives long enough to cast, stop damage during Mirrored Soul, and stay out of the sweeping Wailing Souls beam. Check both boss criteria and turn in the story quest before moving on.",
