        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Clear the named legacy dungeon in the required mode and complete its scripted boss events.\n\n1. Normal is sufficient; Heroic also credits the Normal clear. Enter the CENTRAL portal in the Frozen Halls alcove high on Icecrown Citadel's west face (52.6, 89.4). If the portal rejects the character, complete the faction leader's Forge of Souls -> Pit of Saron quest progression, including the final Tyrannus hand-in.\n\n2. Speak to Jaina or Sylvanas inside. Clear the ghost waves in Frostmourne's chamber, defeating Falric after the first set and Marwyn after the second. Continue down the passage and speak to the faction leader to begin the escape.\n\n3. Stay ahead of the pursuing Lich King and kill every blocking wave at each ice wall. Remain with Jaina/Sylvanas while the wall is broken, then advance together. You are ESCAPING Arthas, not killing him; do not stop to fight him.\n\n4. At the last wall, finish every remaining wave and follow the leader onto the final ledge. Stay for the gunship rescue and encounter completion; leaving before the scripted ending can miss the escape criterion.",
