    [4523] = {
        achievementId = 4523,
        name = "Three Faced",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Three Faced",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A high-level direct kill satisfies the condition; avoid prohibited adds, dispels or transformations.\n\n1. Set Heroic and enter the Forge of Souls through the left Frozen Halls portal high on Icecrown Citadel's west face. Defeat Bronjahm and reach the Devourer of Souls.\n\n2. At high level, kill the Devourer immediately. Later Retail comments confirm that a first-hit kill awards credit; there is no requirement to let it begin casting Phantom Blast.\n\n3. If it survives, interrupt EVERY Phantom Blast. Bring a second interrupter if your cooldown cannot cover consecutive casts. Stop ordinary damage during Mirrored Soul while maintaining interrupts; relying on a reflected blast can hurt the mirrored player and invalidate the achievement.",
