    [4526] = {
        achievementId = 4526,
        name = "We're Not Retreating; We're Advancing in a Different Direction.",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "We're Not Retreating; We're Advancing in a Different Direction.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finish the four scripted escape walls and board the rescuing ship before the six-minute deadline.\n\n1. Set Heroic and enter Halls of Reflection. Complete Falric and Marwyn's ghost waves, then reach Jaina/Sylvanas confronting Arthas. Track this achievement so the six-minute timer is visible.\n\n2. After the confrontation, SPEAK to the faction leader to start the escape. Running down the empty tunnel without the dialogue does not start the timer or encounter.\n\n3. Follow the leader to each of the FOUR ice walls. Kill every spawned ghoul, caster and abomination promptly; the wall opens after its enemies are dead. Keep checking for ranged enemies that stopped behind you. Running faster by itself cannot advance an uncleared wall.\n\n4. Clear the larger final waves, follow the leader to the last ledge and wait for the gunship sequence. The ending still consumes timer time after the final enemy dies, so do not pause for loot or sightseeing.\n\n5. Walk UP the metal ramp onto the rescuing ship as soon as it appears and remain for credit. A later Midnight comment confirms that fast wave kills followed by boarding the ship work; do not leave the instance before the ending registers.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
