        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Obtain a tradable Battered Hilt, then complete its multi-dungeon reforging and Sunwell quest chain.\n\n1. Obtain a Battered Hilt for YOUR faction: Alliance item 50379 or Horde item 50380, usable from level 25. Buy it from the Auction House or farm eligible Frozen Halls trash. Retail 2026 comments confirm drops from NORMAL Pit of Saron, including its first trash packs; this is a rare drop, not a guaranteed reward from a clear. Mailing a hilt to an opposite-faction character converts its faction version; moving it through the Warband bank does not.\n\n2. Use the hilt to start The Battered Hilt. Take it to Caladis Brightspear (Alliance, 74.2, 31.2) or Myralion Sunblaze (Horde, 74.4, 31.2) at Quel'Delar's Rest in Icecrown, south of the Argent Tournament. If a quest marker sends you to the Frozen Halls prematurely, check this outdoor camp first.\n\n3. Accept What The Dragons Know and speak to KRASUS on the TOP of Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight (59.8, 54.4). Follow his dialogue and delivery to your contact in ORIGINAL Northrend Dalaran: Arcanist Tybalin near the Alliance emblem vendors (39.6, 57.4), or Magister Hathorel inside the Horde inn, The Filthy Animal (69.8, 31.4). Legion Dalaran is the wrong city.\n\n4. Accept The Sunreaver Plan (Alliance) or The Silver Covenant's Scheme (Horde), then enter Dalaran's Underbelly. Alliance: kill the hostile SUNREAVER Agent in the northeastern Black Market (about 63, 15). Horde: kill the hostile SILVER COVENANT Agent at the southwestern Cantrips & Crows bar (about 35.6, 56.8). LOOT the Orders, deal with the exit ambusher, and return to your own contact upstairs. The friendly agent for the opposite quest cannot supply your Orders.\n\n5. For A Suitable Disguise, find Shandy Glossgleam on The Threads of Fate's UPSTAIRS BALCONY, around Dalaran 43, 48; the shop entrance is near 43, 50. Speak to him to begin the laundry task. Click the shirts, pants, unmentionables/delicates or water bucket exactly as he calls for them. After the successful sequence, LOOT the sack beside the tub for the Borrowed Tabard, then return to your contact. It is not automatically put into your bags.\n\n6. Use the Borrowed Tabard disguise BEFORE entering the opposing faction's quarter. Alliance: complete A Meeting With The Magister by speaking to Hathorel inside The Filthy Animal. Horde: complete An Audience With The Arcanist by speaking to Tybalin near the Alliance emblem vendors. Obtain Ancient Dragonforged Blades, return to your own contact, then follow Return To Caladis Brightspear / Myralion Sunblaze back to Quel'Delar's Rest. Finish the conversation/scene and accept Reforging The Sword.\n\n7. Enter NORMAL Pit of Saron from the Frozen Halls terrace in southern Icecrown (52.6, 89.4). With Reforging The Sword active, collect FIVE Infused Saronite Bars from the ground, kill Forgemaster Garfrost and loot the Forgemaster's Hammer. USE the hammer at Garfrost's anvil, around the eastern forge (68, 55), to make Reforged Quel'Delar. Return to your faction's quest NPC and take Tempering The Blade. If the dungeon route is locked, follow Jaina/Sylvanas's Frozen Halls introduction through the preceding dungeon first.\n\n8. Enter the Forge of Souls and defeat Bronjahm and the Devourer of Souls. At the Crucible of Souls just beyond the Devourer's platform (northern end of the instance), USE Reforged Quel'Delar to temper it. Return for the next quest, The Halls Of Reflection. Killing the bosses without using the quest item does not temper the blade.\n\n9. Enter the Halls of Reflection with Tempered Quel'Delar. Approach Frostmourne's pedestal at Sword's Rest in the first chamber; your blade animates and attacks. Personally tag it, defeat it and LOOT Subdued Quel'Delar. Keep pets from killing it before you can tag it. Return to your quest NPC; completing all ten dungeon waves and the Lich King escape is not required for this sword objective.\n\n10. Accept Journey To The Sunwell and travel to the LEGACY Isle of Quel'Danas, reachable through Shattrath's island portal at 48.9, 42.1. Speak to Halduron Brightwing OUTSIDE Sunwell Plateau at 44.4, 45.4. Use this original island and its quest phase; the ordinary raid portal does not take you directly to the purification scene.\n\n11. For Thalorien Dawnseeker, go south along the island's Dead Scar to Thalorien's Remains, about 53, 80 OUTDOORS. Interact with the remains, stay for the defense event and defeat the arriving Scourge until Thalorien grants his blessing. Return to Halduron; do not search inside the Sunwell raid for these remains.\n\n12. Accept The Purification of Quel'Delar, then speak to a WARDEN OF THE SUNWELL beside Halduron and choose the quest-entry teleport. In the special Sunwell scene, immerse the supplied Tempered Quel'Delar in the well, let the entire scene finish, and LOOT the restored blade before leaving. Return outside and finish the hand-in. Entering the normal raid or leaving before looting the sword does not finish this quest.\n\n13. Complete the final A Victory For The Silver Covenant / Sunreavers quest actually offered to your class: sword users are directed to Vereesa Windrunner / Archmage Aethas Sunreaver at Dalaran's Violet Citadel, while the alternative weapon branch sends you to Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament. Follow that quest's named recipient, choose a reward and complete the hand-in for achievement credit. Classes that receive a mace can still earn The Sword in the Skull; the title does not require equipping a sword.",
