        source = "The Frozen Throne (25 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat the required legacy raid bosses in the correct size and mode, allowing scripted events to finish.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Clear the Lower Spire, then the Plagueworks (Festergut, Rotface and Putricide), Crimson Hall (Blood Princes and Lana'thel), and Frostwing path to Sindragosa. Activate both valves after Festergut and Rotface so Putricide's room opens. The three wing-end bosses unlock the central Upper Spire transporter to the Frozen Throne.\n\n3. For this Lich King-only objective, Valithria can be bypassed if you have no healing, but Sindragosa must still die. At the Upper Spire transporter, select the Frozen Throne after all three wing-end bosses are finished.\n\n4. Speak to Tirion Fordring at the Frozen Throne, then attack the Lich King. At the scripted raid-kill scene, DO NOT release or leave. Wait for Tirion and Terenas's dialogue, accept the resurrection when offered, and finish the suspended Lich King after Tirion breaks Frostmourne.",
