    [4598] = {
        achievementId = 4598,
        name = "The Ashen Verdict",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Ashen Verdict",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Earn Ashen Verdict Exalted through Icecrown kills; repeated trash farming or raid resets are needed.\n\n1. Enter Icecrown Citadel's raid portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown. Kill the entrance trash and watch your Ashen Verdict reputation increase; neither a faction tabard nor an old emblem currency is required.\n\n2. For repeated trash farming, leave Marrowgar ALIVE, exit, reset the instance and clear the entrance again. Trigger the floor traps to awaken additional Deathbound Wards rather than disabling the traps. Observe the game's instance-entry limit.\n\n3. Alternatively clear raid trash and bosses each weekly reset. Finish at Exalted and speak to the Ashen Verdict NPCs at the entrance for any unlocked ring quests. Killing Marrowgar saves that raid and removes the convenient unsaved-trash reset route.",
