        name = "Glory of the Icecrown Raider (10 player)",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Glory of the Icecrown Raider (10 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Finish the matching Heroic Icecrown meta, including controlled adds, healing, plague stacks and opposite vampire states.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 10 players and Raid Difficulty to HEROIC. Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Track the current meta checklist before killing anything. Complete the four Heroic wing clears, including HEALING Valithria. Heroic Lich King and Neck-Deep in Vile are separate achievements and are not required by this mount meta.\n\n3. In the Lower Spire, preserve five cultist types for Full House; do not one-shot Deathwhisper first. Win the gunship with the boarding limit for this size, and kill Saurfang before too many Marks. In the Plagueworks, avoid ooze explosions, third Inoculated stacks and the Abomination's Regurgitated Ooze.\n\n4. Finish the Blood Princes' empowered-spell avoidance, then plan Lana'thel's two opposite vampire states on separate eligible runs. A second Warband character can supply the other state. Heal Valithria before portals or use every spawned portal, and defeat Sindragosa without exceeding five Mystic Buffet stacks.\n\n5. At the Lich King, wait for at least THIRTY actual Necrotic Plague stacks before damaging him. Complete his scripted ending. Check for the meta reward mail and learn the Bloodbathed (10-player) or Icebound (25-player) Frostbrood Vanquisher after all required criteria are complete.",
