        name = "Storming the Citadel (25 player)",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Storming the Citadel (25 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat the required legacy raid bosses in the correct size and mode, allowing scripted events to finish.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Defeat Marrowgar and Deathwhisper, then take the elevator to the ramparts. Obtain and equip the faction ship's Goblin Rocket Pack, speak to the commander and start the Gunship Battle. Use a cannon as soon as the enemy ship arrives; build heat with Cannon Blast and spend it with Incinerating Blast.\n\n3. If the cannons freeze, jump across using the Rocket Pack, kill the battle-mage and jump back to your own ship. Resume cannon fire until victory. Cross to Saurfang's platform, speak to the commander and defeat Deathbringer Saurfang. Check all FOUR criteria before teleporting upstairs.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 118, x = 0.535, y = 0.855, step = 1, label = "Icecrown Citadel - raid entrance" },
