    [4612] = {
        achievementId = 4612,
        name = "I'm on a Boat (25 player)",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "I'm on a Boat (25 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Kill promptly or use the short prescribed gunship route before the prohibited Icecrown mechanic can occur.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Defeat Marrowgar and Deathwhisper, then take the elevator to the ramparts. Obtain and equip the faction ship's Goblin Rocket Pack, speak to the commander and start the Gunship Battle. Use a cannon as soon as the enemy ship arrives; build heat with Cannon Blast and spend it with Incinerating Blast.\n\n3. Remain on your own gunship and immediately fire its cannon into the enemy ship. Spend the cannon's heat on Incinerating Blast without overheating. At high level, destroying the enemy ship before its battle-mage freezes the cannons avoids all boarding requirements.\n\n4. If the cannons freeze, use the equipped Rocket Pack to board the enemy ship, kill the freezing battle-mage, then return and resume cannon fire. No player may visit the enemy ship more than ONCE during this battle. Coordinate any second boarding rather than reusing a player who has reached the limit.",
