        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Kill promptly or use the short prescribed gunship route before the prohibited Icecrown mechanic can occur.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Clear the Lower Spire: Marrowgar, Deathwhisper, Gunship Battle and Saurfang. Wait for Saurfang's dialogue, then take the transporter to the Upper Spire. Choose the branch named in the next step.\n\n3. Take the Crimson Hall branch. Wait until the Blood Prince Council becomes active, then kill the prince empowered by Invocation of Blood. A high-level fast kill avoids the dangerous empowered spells and is confirmed by later Retail comments.\n\n4. If the encounter lasts, avoid Empowered Shock Vortex, soften Empowered Flame by letting it pass near players, and have Keleseth's target collect Dark Nuclei for Shadow Resonance. No player may take a single spell hit over the achievement's threshold. Finish the empowered prince to end the shared encounter.",
