    [4618] = {
        achievementId = 4618,
        name = "Once Bitten, Twice Shy (25 player)",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Once Bitten, Twice Shy (25 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete separate Lana'thel kills with and without the vampire debuff; plan eligible characters or another reset.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Clear the Lower Spire: Marrowgar, Deathwhisper, Gunship Battle and Saurfang. Wait for Saurfang's dialogue, then take the transporter to the Upper Spire. Choose the branch named in the next step.\n\n3. Defeat the Blood Princes, then go upstairs to Lana'thel. For the NOT-A-VAMPIRE criterion, enter combat by walking up to her or using a non-damaging ability. Wait about FIVE seconds, then kill her BEFORE Essence of the Blood Queen appears. An immediate kill before combat registers can give no credit.\n\n4. On another eligible run, enter combat without attacking and wait until YOUR Essence of the Blood Queen debuff appears. Kill her as soon as it is visible. You are already a vampire at that point; do not wait for Frenzied Bloodthirst or mind control.\n\n5. Check both criteria for this raid size. You can use the next weekly reset on the same character, or another Warband character with an unused lockout: later Retail comments confirm the shared criteria can combine across characters. Complete the separate 10- and 25-player achievements in their respective sizes.",
