    [4619] = {
        achievementId = 4619,
        name = "Portal Jockey (25 player)",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Portal Jockey (25 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Use a healing-capable character or helper for Valithria and meet the required portal condition.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Clear the Lower Spire: Marrowgar, Deathwhisper, Gunship Battle and Saurfang. Wait for Saurfang's dialogue, then take the transporter to the Upper Spire. Choose the branch named in the next step.\n\n3. Choose the Frostwing branch and reach Valithria. NORMAL is the straightforward solo bandage route. Kill the four channelers first to start combat, then heal Valithria herself to full before any portals spawn. Direct friendly-target healing or an effective current bandage can work on Normal.\n\n4. If ordinary bandaging is interrupted or cannot finish, bring a healer or use suitable friendly-target healing such as a Spirit Beast's Spirit Mend or Darkmoon Deck: Dance. Heroic has ongoing damage and may need a different method; do not assume an old low-level bandage works there.\n\n5. If portals appear, EVERY portal in EVERY set must be entered by someone before it expires. One player entering a single portal is insufficient. Solo, finish before the first set; entering a portal with nobody left outside can reset the encounter. Check Portal Jockey credit before moving on.",
