    [4623] = {
        achievementId = 4623,
        name = "Shadowmourne",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Shadowmourne",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Complete the restricted-class legendary chain, coordinated infusion mechanics and fifty weekly raid shards.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to NORMAL (Heroic also satisfies this achievement). Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Use a Warrior, Paladin or Death Knight. Reach Friendly with the Ashen Verdict by killing ICC entrance trash, then accept The Sacred and the Corrupt from Highlord Darion Mograine at the entrance. Buying a chest reward or mount from someone else does not award the legendary weapon achievement.\n\n3. With the quest active, go to Frostmourne Cavern in Dragonblight (74.4, 23.5). Interact with Light's Vengeance, wait through the scene and complete the follow-up combat/interactions. Also obtain 25 Primordial Saronite and loot Festergut's and Rotface's Acidic Blood from their 25-player kills; return all four components to Darion for Shadow's Edge.\n\n4. Equip Shadow's Edge for A Feast of Souls. Collect FIFTY souls from ICC enemies after Shadow's Fate has registered on them; immediate kills can miss the quest counter. Use a non-damaging application or controlled low damage and check the counter before clearing a large pack.\n\n5. Unholy Infusion: with Shadow's Edge equipped, have a helper hold Putricide while you use the experiment table to become an Abomination. Absorb puddles to reach 100 energy, activate Shadow Infusion and finish its cast, then defeat Putricide after the infusion buff is present.\n\n6. Blood Infusion preparation: keep Shadow's Edge equipped at 25-player Lana'thel. With a helper holding her, stand nearest that helper to receive Blood Mirror and confirm your Gushing Wound quest debuff. Arrange for YOU to receive Essence of the Blood Queen. Stop boss damage and heal while waiting. Eight total players allow the normal expanding bite chain with everyone alive; smaller groups need a planned way to remove or resurrect previously bitten helpers.\n\n7. When your sixty-second Essence expires, Frenzied Bloodthirst replaces your action bar with Vampiric Bite. Immediately bite an unbitten helper. Repeat on the next two cycles, personally landing THREE bites. Other vampires must feed on separate eligible players so they do not become mind-controlled while you wait. Avoid Divine Shield or similar effects that remove your quest debuff. Only after Gushing Wound becomes the completed infusion buff, kill Lana'thel and return to Darion for Frost Infusion.\n\n8. Frost Infusion: keep Shadow's Edge equipped, face Sindragosa and survive FOUR Frost Breaths before killing her. Hold damage and heal while waiting; a normal one-shot cannot infuse the weapon.\n\n9. Complete The Splintered Throne by looting FIFTY Shadowfrost Shards from eligible 25-player ICC boss kills over weekly resets. Return to Darion to forge Shadowmourne, receive and equip it. The separate Sealed Chest reward chain happens afterward and is not required for this wielder achievement.",
