        name = "Heroic: The Frostwing Halls (10 player)",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Heroic: The Frostwing Halls (10 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the required Icecrown wing or full clear, including healing Valithria rather than skipping her.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 10 players and Raid Difficulty to HEROIC. Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Clear the Lower Spire: Marrowgar, Deathwhisper, Gunship Battle and Saurfang. Wait for Saurfang's dialogue, then take the transporter to the Upper Spire. Choose the branch named in the next step.\n\n3. Take the Frostwing branch to Valithria Dreamwalker. Bring direct friendly-target healing or a suitable healing item. Start combat by killing the four channelers, then heal HER to full while clearing the attacking adds. This is a healing encounter: skipping past her does not satisfy the wing-clear achievement.\n\n4. If your class cannot finish the healing, bring a healer; on Heroic, ongoing damage can interrupt ordinary bandages. Recent Retail comments also report Darkmoon Deck: Dance or a Pump-Action Bandage Gun. Check that Valithria's criterion actually credits before continuing.\n\n5. Take the elevator beyond Valithria, clear the spider gauntlet below, then defeat the frost wyrms Rimefang and Spinestalker outside. Wait for Sindragosa to land and kill her. Valithria AND Sindragosa are required.",
