        source = "Heroic: Fall of the Lich King (25 player)",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the required Icecrown wing or full clear, including healing Valithria rather than skipping her.\n\n1. Outside Icecrown Citadel, set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players and Raid Difficulty to HEROIC. Enter the RAID portal at 53.5, 85.5 in Icecrown; the higher Frozen Halls dungeon entrance is different.\n\n2. Defeat Marrowgar and Deathwhisper, then take the elevator to the ramparts. Obtain and equip the faction ship's Goblin Rocket Pack, speak to the commander and start the Gunship Battle. Use a cannon as soon as the enemy ship arrives; build heat with Cannon Blast and spend it with Incinerating Blast.\n\n3. Finish the gunship victory and kill Saurfang. Upstairs, kill Festergut and Rotface, use both room valves, and kill Putricide. Clear the Blood Princes and Lana'thel in the Crimson Hall.\n\n4. Heal Valithria Dreamwalker to FULL, then descend through the spider gauntlet and kill Sindragosa after her two frost wyrms. Bring a healer or effective friendly-target healing item; bypassing Valithria leaves this all-bosses achievement incomplete.\n\n5. With Putricide, Lana'thel and Sindragosa defeated, use the Upper Spire's central transporter to reach the Frozen Throne. Speak to Tirion Fordring at the Frozen Throne, then attack the Lich King. At the scripted raid-kill scene, DO NOT release or leave. Wait for Tirion and Terenas's dialogue, accept the resurrection when offered, and finish the suspended Lich King after Tirion breaks Frostmourne.",
